WEBVTT

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.960
Right on target!

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.410
Damn, I'm out of things to teach you.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:38.180
I can't believe you're just an 11 year old girl, Chiko!

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.970
I'm not 11.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.490
As of today, I'm 12.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:18.760
Please give me anything you need washed.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.240
Sure.  Wash this, will you?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.050
Sure!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:26.750
Chiko, did you wash my shirt?

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:29.040
I put it in the usual location.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.290
Your German's gotten pretty good.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.250
Thanks.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.800
OK, that does it.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.510
Please go pick up some ingredients for tonight's dinner.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.320
OK!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:42.810
Oops.  Hey, Chiko.  Also...

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.760
Whiskey — something cheap and strong, right?

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:48.270
A-Ah, you remembered.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.280
Muta-san.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:58.800
I'm on my way to go shopping.  Do you need anything?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.030
Oh, yeah...

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.950
Are you all right?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.010
You fool!

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:12.610
Don't drop your guard after just one kick!

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.560
You don't know what will happen when you set foot outside here.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.050
You need to finely hone your senses.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:17.990
OK.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.390
Also,

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:23.500
if you're opponent is a man, aim for his most sensitive spot.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.680
Most sensitive?

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.050
His crotch.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.040
You don't throw someone with your own power.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.910
Use your opponent's power against them.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:47.910
OK.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.050
That one wasn't bad.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:04.200
All right!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.420
Keep it up, Chiko!

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.950
Go, Chiko!  All the way up!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.230
Come on!  You can't lose to her, Goro!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.730
Oh no!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.380
Goro-san, take my hand.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.130
I lost.  You're pretty agile, Chiko.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.840
I won.

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:49.090
Now pay up.

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:50.090
Damn it!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:52.140
Goro, no dinner for you!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.390
What?!  No way!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.490
Hey, stop goofing off.  There's work to do.

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:00.900
Chiko, what happened to the dinner preparations?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.150
R-Right!  I'll get right on it!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:06.910
You should be doing things that are a little more suitable for girls.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.400
Right.

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:19.270
Thanks.  It was delicious.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:20.920
Oh, just leave those there.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.680
I can't believe she won against Goro.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:29.130
Thanks to her, I made quite a profit.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.680
See, I told you!

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.430
No one's more agile than Chiko.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.730
And I hear Muta is teaching her how to fight?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:38.290
I'm teaching her German and sleight of hand.

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.320
We're teaching her knife throwing and self-defense too.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.190
She's really passionate about learning.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.200
It's been a year since she arrived?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:51.930
Maybe it's high time we let her try her hand at a job, huh?

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.700
Yeah.  She'll make a great thief.

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.210
Don't say such foolish things.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:02.340
You know, don't you think she's started to look a bit like the boss?

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:04.850
Yeah.  I've been thinking the same thing.

00:06:04.850 --> 00:06:08.320
She sometimes even gets that same strange look in her eyes.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.320
Yeah, and just the other day...

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.980
Damn it!  It's not opening no matter what.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.700
And I know this is the right combination.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.190
What's wrong?

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:23.970
We got the treasure just fine,

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.920
but I can't open the safe!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:33.460
May I try?

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:35.150
Sure.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.090
There's more than one way to skin a cat.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.180
It's open.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.430
That sounds like something the boss would say.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.180
You think?

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.650
It's because she's taken a special liking to him.

00:07:07.080 --> 00:07:08.480
It's Chiko.

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.430
Come in.

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:15.660
Hey.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.260
Uhm, may I borrow one again?

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:19.450
Sure.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.180
Take whatever you'd like.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:21.850
OK.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.560
Do you enjoy reading?

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:29.420
Yes.  I've only been reading detective novels.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:34.040
I love to study.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:36.220
Reading isn't studying.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.720
It's just for fun.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.910
You're a pig if you don't read books,

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.730
but you're a dog if you think you can take lessons from them.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.170
A good book is like an old friend.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:55.560
You'll find out new things about yourself each time you read it.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:59.720
I learn more from his words than from any book.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.950
Hey, bring the check!

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:09.460
Damn, I'm broke already?

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:13.470
The search for Chizuko-san is progressing quite smoothly.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:17.830
Unfortunately, I've run out of funding again...

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.480
Understood.  I'll prepare some more.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:22.980
Please keep searching for Chizuko.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:31.060
That detective is performing for you just as you expected, isn't he?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:35.490
Yes, there's no way that man could possibly find her.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:39.820
Which is just what you intended.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.750
Just what we intended.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.800
Dear, how are you feeling?

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:05.640
Our attorney Kurosaki and I will manage to run the company somehow, so please rest easy.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.520
You must focus on getting well.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:11.520
When did you start...

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:14.700
Come now, here's your soup.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.030
When did you start poisoning my food...

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:21.180
You're a wretched woman.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:24.540
You wanted everything for yourself all along.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.610
Hurry and get better, dear.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:52.320
This is where they'll hold the black-market auction.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.610
What are you doing here?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.900
Ah, well, this place is so big that I got lost.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.610
That's doubtful.  Come with us.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:03.540
Hold on a second.  I'm sure my companions will be looking for me.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.250
There's no use resisting.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:08.060
Hey, hey.  Are they serious?

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:12.630
Don't be so angry.  I really am just lost.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.880
What's this?

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.380
So this is where you are.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:20.190
Geez, what a careless guy.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.840
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.720
Let's blow this popsicle stand.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.640
You saved me, Kai.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:34.010
According to Ken and Kai's report,

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:37.010
the black-market auction will begin tomorrow night at 7 o'clock.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:43.600
Our target this time, "The Lorelei's Tear", will be brought to the hotel an hour early, at 6 o'clock.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:49.990
There's a statue of a maiden that has brought mankind rest and tranquility since the Middle Ages.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:54.800
"The Lorelei's Tear" refers to its eye — the world's largest sapphire.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:01.090
Though it's the property of the people, someone slipped in during the war and carried it away.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.760
Now they're going to turn it into feed for the pigs swarming to this auction.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:06.610
Before that happens...

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.850
...we'll snatch it.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:10.070
That's a pretty dangerous assignment.

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:12.780
The hotel will be crawling with armed guards.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:15.730
One of them almost pulled a gun on me!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.250
It'll be no easier than if they were police officers.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:20.740
So how will we steal it?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.340
The auction hall is on the third floor.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:27.240
The number of guards will be limited by the size of the elevator.

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.600
I see!

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:32.750
We'll cause a blackout and grab the treasure.  Then we can escape through the ceiling hatch.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.970
I wonder if that'll be so easy.

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:36.250
So, who's gonna do it?

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.260
We can't send Ken or Kai.  They know their faces.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:44.080
You're out too, Skipper.  You aren't getting through any small hatches with that body.

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.060
I'll do it.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.490
Hold on.  There's someone here that's even more suitable.

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:52.270
Who do you mean?

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.440
It's Chiko!

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.840
Those guys won't be expecting a young girl.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:03.590
She's agile enough.  She won't have any problem escaping through the hatch.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.200
No good.  She's not ready for a job yet.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.280
And what's more, it's dangerous.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:10.930
She'll only need us to help when they chase her.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:13.000
Chiko can handle it well enough.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.060
It's not your place to decide whether she goes or not.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.550
You're right.  Chiko should decide.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.860
But if she's one of us, she needs to get some work experience.

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.910
Or she won't survive down the road.

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:30.890
Chiko's already prepared herself for it.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.600
Right?

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:34.310
I...

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:37.630
I'll...

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:38.570
...do it!

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.540
Chiko...

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.070
You understand, don't you?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.570
We're thieves!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:51.540
What I understand is that the thing no one else in the world would give me...

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.220
...is what everyone here has given me.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.620
It's not that I want to become a thief.

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.960
I want all of us to be a true family.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:05.690
Chiko...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:09.200
I'll help with your work.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.180
Because I'm the boss's...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.640
I'm Twenty Faces's daughter.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.720
We'll cause the hotel to blackout at 6:05.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.830
Meet us on the roof.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:42.440
Skipper, you look like you're giving away your own daughter.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:43.550
Shut up.

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:45.300
They're coming.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.240
Take it from here.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.140
OK.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.280
Three of them.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:27.180
It's fine; I can do this.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:37.780
It stopped.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.650
I hope this car doesn't fall.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.810
What's with this kid?  She grabbed onto me all of a sudden.

00:14:46.810 --> 00:14:49.320
She's probably scared of the dark.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.110
Give that back!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.080
What's wrong?

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:51.870
The briefcase!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.120
The kid's gone!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.650
What's going on?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:58.910
Up there!

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:05.960
Shit!  Where did she go?

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.920
It's moving.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.440
Looks like the backup generator kicked in already.

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:13.190
That's sooner than we expected.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.260
This is bad.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.770
You're not getting away, kid!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:36.030
Shit!  She's going down!  On the next car!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.890
It's stopped on the next floor down.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.620
Take the emergency staircase.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.960
We'll meet you down there.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.500
We'll catch her in a pincer.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.420
Oops.  You're not getting away.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.500
We've got you surrounded.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:04.380
The jig's up,

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.560
young lady.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.230
Listen.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.030
You won't be able to strike at them with that body of yours.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:13.990
You need to slam into them as hard as you can and run like hell.

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:24.040
Crap!  Hold it!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.090
You don't throw someone with your own power.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.880
Use your opponent's power against them.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:55.190
You're a real pain in the ass.

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:57.120
It was negligent of me thinking you were just a kid.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.960
What?!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.290
The jewel was stolen.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:15.130
The thief is some kid.  She's on her way up using the elevator.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.180
Why up?

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.260
I don't know.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:19.490
In any case, let's follow her up in the other elevator.

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:21.380
What's with you, you asshole?!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:22.140
Say it again, I dare you!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.520
I'll say it as many times as I want to!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:24.800
You god damned pig!

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.080
Hey, you're in our way.  Move.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.520
What's your problem?!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:29.900
These idiots...

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:33.070
Don't be stupid!  Don't pull that out here.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.400
Let's head for the stairs.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.160
Hey, you two.  Are you having a pleasant day?

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.930
Who the hell are you?

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:42.860
Move!

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:45.540
Oh, you don't like flowers?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.660
In that case...

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:49.170
All right.  Don't move now.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.750
This is fun!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.170
Hey, hey.  Better head down or you'll catch a cold!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.170
Want to try and pull your gun?

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:02.930
Then this world will become just a memory.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.910
Now I just need to make it to the roof.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.280
There!  There she is!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.410
Don't let her escape!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.330
Think.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:33.920
What would he do?

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.170
What would he...?

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.620
All right.  That's as far as you get.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.480
Give that back to us.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.200
Hey!  What did you do with the jewel?!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.410
It's leaving in a car by now.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.700
What?!  You little brat!

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.710
How dare you do something like that!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.480
Go after it immediately.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:09.210
Hurry!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:12.060
I'll dispose of this damn brat.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.270
She's all yours.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.320
Mister.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:31.980
You did good, Chiko.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.180
Come, let's head back.

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:35.310
Back to our house.

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:36.270
OK.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:39.580
Just make sure we're not forgetting anything, OK?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.970
Chiko!  Boss!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.410
Mister, what song is that?

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.920
Was I humming?

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.850
Yes, a very nice song.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.680
It's an old song.  Everyone knows it.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:52.180
I don't know that one.
